{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.BorromeanThreeBodyCluster","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_lt","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L90-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_le","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L80-L88","doc":"**The Brunnian deficit is bounded by `h⁴`**: `0 ≤ 1 − τ_Borr(h) ≤ h⁴`, with the upper bound\nstrict for `h ≠ 0`. At the substrate pin `h ≈ 0.209` this is `≈ 1.9 × 10⁻³` — a pure\nq-deformation quantity two orders below the `O(1)` classical cross terms. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.brunnian_factor_lt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.brunnian_factor_lt_one","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L75-L78","doc":"The factor `(3+h²)/(h²+4)` is strictly below `1` for every real `h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_eq_h4_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.one_sub_tauBorromean_eq_h4_mul","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L70-L73","doc":"`1 − τ_Borr(h) = h⁴ · r(h)` with `r(h) = (3+h²)/(h²+4)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace_sub_eq_zero_of_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace_sub_eq_zero_of_eq","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L63-L66","doc":"A component-preserving pair has **no** order-zero cross term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.n4_instance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.n4_instance","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L58-L61","doc":"The `n = 4` instance behind T1: a knot (`c = 1`) and a three-component closure (`c = 3`)\nhave order-zero traces `1/8` and `1/2`, cross term `−3/8`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace_eq_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace_eq_iff","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L45-L56","doc":"**The order-zero cross term vanishes iff the component counts agree.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.componentTrace","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossTermOrderZeroComponentCount.lean#L41-L43","doc":"The component-count trace at `q = 1`: a closure with `c` components on `n` strands has\nMarkov trace `2^c / 2^n` (the Ocneanu trace with `z = 1/2` on the group algebra). ","signatureChunk":0}]}